{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/44f42d008d1a579945192970dcd220a3.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is an RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange forgotten castle. Your past now only a fading memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with familiar fruity colored allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your\u00a0journey to return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/3b2391ab40648fa0afea11e13097d777.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into a strange hand-drawn world with an intriguing narrative. Interact with the environment to discover new information to document in the <i>Tome of Knowledge</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/46862d6ee627e89ba00884025af0b483.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience three\u00a0immersive story chapters packed with unique gameplay systems and characters; each chapter requires roughly an hour or more to complete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/cb0d719dabbe3451b26b9ccea8d13b69.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight alongside <i>Mayday</i>, <i>Cloud</i> and <i>Ophelia</i> in your journey to return home. Each with a distinct, lovable personality with an important connection to the Princess.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/a78b022e6a17d2a4e0531b2c72d26480.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master a unique turn-based battle system. Carefully manage your party resources to combine <i>Energy</i> and <i>Revenge</i> abilities to slay a large roster of powerful monsters. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/be419b5f426736d52596983485992296.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore diverse environments, complete character quests, and gather items to forge powerful new ability sets. Leave no stone unturned to find the coveted <i>Shadow Weapons</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/f46d301a36c760c30624671134aac111.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play through the story on several optional difficulty settings, including Irregularis: where saving is disabled and checkpoints are disabled. Once you die, <i>that's it</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/5b2362b1a4d4bca97d4987305985062b.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hunt down rare and hidden story Achievements with an always-offline progress system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>...What's not to love?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/e46498f37cbc55f3d0f42f7510d374e8.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365680?t=1770895501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/a164e6206358bff00addbb93b5138e3c87514853/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770895501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/e5b29842177de15ff0549b0ee49cba7f5e69b4bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770895501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/e5b29842177de15ff0549b0ee49cba7f5e69b4bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770895501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/44f42d008d1a579945192970dcd220a3.avif?t=1770895501\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is an RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange forgotten castle. You